<https://github.com/corrado877/CognitiveBiasOntologies/blob/main/CognitiveBiasOntologies#Thing> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "a class for defining any kind of information about which a person has some knowledge"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/affectedBy#influencedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A relation between qualities. A quality is influenced by another quality if the value of the latter affects the value of the former."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
